# Exclude client-side and build tools
OpenBound/
OpenBound Asset Tools/
OpenBound Management Tools/
OpenBound Patcher/
OpenBound Game Launcher/
WP Image Processing/

# Exclude build artifacts
**/obj/
**/bin/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# Exclude version control
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Exclude IDE files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Exclude Docker files from being copied into containers
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore

# Exclude documentation and license files (optional - can include if needed)
**/*.md
!**/README.md

# Exclude config and template files
**/*.Template.*
**/Config/

# Exclude test files (if any)
**/*Tests/
**/*.Tests/

# Exclude unnecessary files
**/.mgstats
**/packages/